43\":344,\"_291\":345},1790861314.186257,1790861399.244335,\"content\",{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":341},\"status\",\"finished_successfully\",\"end_turn\",\"weight\",1,\"metadata\",{\"_297\":298,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":301,\"_302\":303,\"_304\":305,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":308,\"_309\":310,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":315,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":319,\"_320\":319,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":277,\"_324\":10},\"recipient\",\"all\",\"channel\",\"final\",\"finish_details\",{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":336},\"is_complete\",\"citations\",[],\"content_references\",[],\"story_events\",[],\"resolved_model_slug\",\"code_blocks\",{\"_325\":326,\"_327\":328},\"search_result_groups\",[],\"cot_version\",\"v5\",\"conversation_followup_suggestions_eligible\",\"request_id\",\"85870422-7a15-493f-91c6-6dde9e3e2e3f\",\"message_type\",\"next\",\"turn_exchange_id\",\"1e81b091-1193-4a6b-bead-6ab81e7a11cf\",\"working_turn_id\",\"model_slug\",\"can_save\",\"parent_id\",\"shared_conversation_id\",\"0\",{\"_273\":333,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"1\",{\"_273\":329,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"8dxoc6\",\"edited\",\"previewable\",\"preview_language\",\"9wr90w\",\"stop\",\"stop_tokens\",[337],200002,\"content_type\",\"text\",\"parts\",[342],\"Yes ra, **1:1 ratio logos are perfect** for our website. 👍\\n\\nFor the **Logo Design** section, 1:1 actually works very well because:\\n- all 3 logos will have equal visual space\\n- cards will look neat and consistent\\n- no stretching/cropping needed\\n- professional portfolio look\\n\\nSo keep your logo files **exactly 1:1**.\\n\\nJust name them:\\n\\n```text\\nlogo-1.png\\nlogo-2.png\\nlogo-3.png\\n```\\n\\nand put them here:\\n\\n```text\\nimages/\\n└── logos/\\n    ├── logo-1.png\\n    ├── logo-2.png\\n    └── logo-3.png\\n```\\n\\nThen we'll move to **Posters**.\",\"role\",\"assistant\",{},{\"_273\":277,\"_280\":349,\"_54\":350,\"_56\":350,\"_284\":351,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":352,\"_293\":294},\"876d2be3-c833-4b94-9e39-a91baa2fd7ab\",[81],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":357},1790861314.160704,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":354},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":315,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":319,\"_320\":319,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":347,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},\"is_visually_hidden_from_conversation\",[355],\"\",\"system\",{},{\"_273\":347,\"_280\":361,\"_54\":362,\"_56\":363,\"_284\":364,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":365,\"_293\":294},\"b26d08d3-be0c-48ca-96b0-d14231fa0277\",[277],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":374},1790861306.204,1790861320.161974,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":371},{\"_366\":367,\"_314\":315,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":319,\"_320\":319,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},\"serialization_metadata\",{\"_369\":370},\"message_source\",\"custom_symbol_offsets\",[],[372],\"i have lofo 1:1 ratios is it ok na\",\"user\",{},{\"_273\":359,\"_280\":378,\"_54\":379,\"_56\":380,\"_284\":381,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":382,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"213ab43f-190f-45af-9e5e-5182315b131e\",[347],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":393},1790861293.71967,1790861296.92254,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":391},{\"_297\":383,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":384,\"_302\":385,\"_304\":386,\"_306\":109,\"_309\":387,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":388,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":389,\"_320\":389,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":376,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":390},[],[],[],[],\"d83b6e7c-71fd-4a6d-aa02-f7a285b447a2\",\"07782a70-a5b6-4469-b4d2-59bb5840f0a8\",[337],[392],\"Yes ra. **Next = My Work section.** 🔥\\n\\nThis is actually the **most important section** for your freelancer website because clients need to see your actual work.\\n\\nYour current structure is already there, so **don't change HTML/CSS yet**.\\n\\n### First, let's add your real work\\n\\nWe'll do it category by category:\\n\\n**1. Logos**\\n- 3 actual logo images\\n- clean presentation\\n- no unnecessary text\\n\\n**2. Posters**\\n- 3 actual poster designs\\n- preserve their original look\\n\\n**3. Video Editing**\\n- 3 videos\\n- **9:16 ratio maintained**\\n- no forced square cropping\\n\\n**4. Meta Ads**\\n- 2 client reports\\n- **original horizontal ratio maintained**\\n\\n**5. SEO**\\n- Coming Soon for now\\n\\n### Start with Logos\\n\\nSend me your **3 logo images** here, preferably **all 3 together**.\\n\\nI'll tell you exactly:\\n- what filename to give each\\n- where to put them\\n- what small HTML change is needed\\n- how they'll appear in the website\\n\\nThen we'll immediately move to **Posters → Videos → Meta Ads → SEO**.\",{},{\"_273\":376,\"_280\":397,\"_54\":398,\"_56\":398,\"_284\":399,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":400,\"_293\":294},\"92ad7243-33e7-406a-8507-48da4d764f74\",[359],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":402},1790861293.707459,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":401},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":388,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":389,\"_320\":389,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":395,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":395,\"_280\":406,\"_54\":407,\"_56\":408,\"_284\":409,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":410,\"_293\":294},\"dec781f2-ec02-48de-9e6d-1ea5ee78fbc7\",[376],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":415},1790861285.755,1790861297.018842,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":413},{\"_366\":411,\"_314\":388,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":389,\"_320\":389,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":412},[],[414],\"ok nxt\",{},{\"_273\":404,\"_280\":419,\"_54\":420,\"_56\":421,\"_284\":422,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":423,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"09ece6bd-a284-4390-aef1-0476c8a63d57\",[395],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":437},1790861242.511632,1790861267.449527,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":435},{\"_297\":424,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":425,\"_302\":426,\"_304\":427,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":428,\"_309\":429,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":430,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":431,\"_320\":431,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":417,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":434},[],[],[],{\"_325\":432},[],\"12ac6b33-c342-43c4-a231-c7bd3f256bfc\",\"9e2aba88-b2f4-4c53-892c-365d854abf32\",{\"_273\":433,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"4ji5y7\",[337],[436],\"Exactly ra. **Problem dark theme kaadu — visual hierarchy ledu.**  \\nEvery section same dark background + same cards kabatti website flat ga kanipistundi.\\n\\nLet's change the design direction to:\\n\\n- **Hero:** deep navy + blue accent\\n- **About:** warm off-white section\\n- **Services:** very light blue/grey background + white cards\\n- **My Work:** deep navy again, so portfolio gets strong contrast\\n- **Why Work With Me:** soft lavender/blue background\\n- **Contact:** dark blue gradient\\n- Cards: white / navy / subtle tinted cards depending on section\\n- Buttons: blue + dark variations\\n- More spacing, borders, shadows, rounded corners\\n- No rainbow colors, no childish colors\\n- **Professional agency/freelancer style**\\n\\nYou **don't need to change the HTML or JS**. Just replace your current `style.css` with the redesigned CSS below.\\n\\n```css\\n/* =========================\\n   RESET\\n========================= */\\n\\n* {\\n    margin: 0;\\n    padding: 0;\\n    box-sizing: border-box;\\n}\\n\\nhtml {\\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\\n}\\n\\nbody {\\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\n    color: #182235;\\n    background: #f7f9fc;\\n    line-height: 1.6;\\n}\\n\\na {\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n    color: inherit;\\n}\\n\\nimg,\\nvideo {\\n    max-width: 100%;\\n    display: block;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   NAVBAR\\n========================= */\\n\\n.navbar {\\n    position: sticky;\\n    top: 0;\\n    z-index: 1000;\\n\\n    height: 76px;\\n    padding: 0 7%;\\n\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n\\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);\\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e6eaf0;\\n    backdrop-filter: blur(15px);\\n}\\n\\n.logo img {\\n    width: 48px;\\n    height: 48px;\\n    object-fit: contain;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links {\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 32px;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links a {\\n    color: #526075;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links a:hover {\\n    color: #2457d6;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-button,\\n.primary-button {\\n    background: #2457d6;\\n    color: white;\\n    padding: 12px 21px;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-button:hover,\\n.primary-button:hover {\\n    background: #1744b4;\\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   HERO\\n========================= */\\n\\n.hero {\\n    min-height: 88vh;\\n    padding: 90px 7%;\\n\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 70px;\\n\\n    background:\\n        radial-gradient(\\n            circle at 80% 20%,\\n            rgba(67, 112, 230, 0.16),\\n            transparent 35%\\n        ),\\n        #eef3fb;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-small-text,\\n.section-label {\\n    color: #2457d6;\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero h1 {\\n    margin: 18px 0;\\n    font-size: clamp(45px, 6vw, 76px);\\n    line-height: 1.04;\\n    letter-spacing: -3px;\\n    color: #111a2b;\\n}\\n\\n.hero h1 span {\\n    color: #2457d6;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-description {\\n    max-width: 590px;\\n    color: #5c687b;\\n    font-size: 17px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-buttons {\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 14px;\\n    margin-top: 30px;\\n}\\n\\n.secondary-button {\\n    padding: 12px 21px;\\n    border: 1px solid #cbd4e2;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    color: #26344b;\\n    background: #ffffff;\\n}\\n\\n.secondary-button:hover {\\n    border-color: #2457d6;\\n    color: #2457d6;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-visual {\\n    display: flex;\\n    justify-content: center;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card {\\n    width: 340px;\\n    min-height: 400px;\\n    padding: 42px;\\n\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    justify-content: flex-end;\\n\\n    border-radius: 28px;\\n\\n    background:\\n        linear-gradient(\\n            145deg,\\n            #162544,\\n            #244f9d\\n        );\\n\\n    color: white;\\n\\n    box-shadow:\\n        0 25px 60px rgba(27, 55, 105, 0.25);\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card p {\\n    color: #bcd1ff;\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card h2 {\\n    font-size: 43px;\\n    line-height: 1.04;\\n    margin: 18px 0;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card span {\\n    color: #d5e1f7;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   COMMON SECTIONS\\n========================= */\\n\\n.section {\\n    padding: 110px 7%;\\n}\\n\\n.section-heading {\\n    max-width: 700px;\\n    margin-bottom: 55px;\\n}\\n\\n.section-heading h2 {\\n    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);\\n    line-height: 1.1;\\n    margin: 12px 0 16px;\\n    color: #172238;\\n}\\n\\n.section-heading \u003e p:last-child {\\n    color: #697589;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   ABOUT\\n========================= */\\n\\n.about {\\n    background: #ffffff;\\n}\\n\\n.about-content {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;\\n    gap: 75px;\\n    align-items: center;\\n}\\n\\n.about-text p {\\n    color: #647086;\\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\\n    line-height: 1.85;\\n}\\n\\n.about-text .about-intro {\\n    color: #202d42;\\n    font-size: 21px;\\n    line-height: 1.65;\\n}\\n\\n.about-highlights {\\n    display: grid;\\n    gap: 15px;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card {\\n    padding: 24px 26px;\\n\\n    background: #f5f8fd;\\n    border: 1px solid #e1e7f0;\\n    border-radius: 16px;\\n\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card:hover {\\n    transform: translateX(6px);\\n    background: #eef4ff;\\n    border-color: #bfd0f4;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card span,\\n.service-number {\\n    color: #2457d6;\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card h3 {\\n    color: #1c293e;\\n    margin: 10px 0 6px;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card p {\\n    color: #6c788b;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   SERVICES\\n========================= */\\n\\n.services {\\n    background: #eef2f7;\\n}\\n\\n.services-grid {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\\n    gap: 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card {\\n    padding: 31px;\\n\\n    background: #ffffff;\\n    border: 1px solid #e0e6ef;\\n    border-radius: 18px;\\n\\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(30, 45, 70, 0.05);\\n\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card:hover {\\n    transform: translateY(-7px);\\n    border-color: #b9c9eb;\\n    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30, 45, 70, 0.09);\\n}\\n\\n.service-card h3 {\\n    color: #1b2940;\\n    margin: 18px 0 10px;\\n    font-size: 19px;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card p {\\n    color: #697589;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   MY WORK\\n========================= */\\n\\n.work {\\n    background: #111a2c;\\n}\\n\\n.work .section-heading h2 {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n}\\n\\n.work .section-heading \u003e p:last-child {\\n    color: #9eabc0;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-filters {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    gap: 10px;\\n    margin-bottom: 55px;\\n}\\n\\n.filter-button {\\n    padding: 10px 17px;\\n\\n    background: transparent;\\n    color: #b1bdcf;\\n\\n    border: 1px solid #35435b;\\n    border-radius: 7px;\\n\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.filter-button:hover,\\n.filter-button.active {\\n    background: #4c7fe6;\\n    color: white;\\n    border-color: #4c7fe6;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-category {\\n    margin-bottom: 75px;\\n}\\n\\n.category-heading {\\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\\n}\\n\\n.category-heading h3 {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    font-size: 25px;\\n}\\n\\n.category-heading p {\\n    color: #8794aa;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-grid {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\\n    gap: 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-card {\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n\\n    background: #ffffff;\\n    border: 1px solid #273650;\\n    border-radius: 16px;\\n\\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-image {\\n    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    background: #edf1f7;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-image img {\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: 100%;\\n    object-fit: cover;\\n    transition: 0.35s;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-card:hover img {\\n    transform: scale(1.04);\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-info {\\n    padding: 19px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-info h4 {\\n    color: #1d2a3e;\\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-info p {\\n    color: #748095;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   VIDEOS\\n========================= */\\n\\n.video-container {\\n    background: #05070c;\\n}\\n\\n.video-container video {\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: auto;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   META ADS\\n========================= */\\n\\n.meta-ads-container {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    gap: 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.report-image {\\n    background: #edf1f7;\\n}\\n\\n.report-image img {\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: auto;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   SEO\\n========================= */\\n\\n.coming-soon {\\n    padding: 55px;\\n    text-align: center;\\n\\n    background: #17233a;\\n    border: 1px dashed #53647e;\\n    border-radius: 18px;\\n}\\n\\n.coming-soon span {\\n    color: #7da5ff;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n}\\n\\n.coming-soon p {\\n    color: #9ba8bb;\\n    margin-top: 8px;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   WHY WORK WITH ME\\n========================= */\\n\\n.why-me {\\n    background: #f3f0fa;\\n}\\n\\n.why-me-grid {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\\n    gap: 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.why-card {\\n    padding: 31px;\\n\\n    background: #ffffff;\\n    border: 1px solid #e4dff0;\\n    border-radius: 18px;\\n\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.why-card:hover {\\n    transform: translateY(-5px);\\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(65, 50, 100, 0.08);\\n}\\n\\n.why-card h3 {\\n    color: #27213d;\\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\\n}\\n\\n.why-card p {\\n    color: #707086;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   CONTACT\\n========================= */\\n\\n.contact {\\n    text-align: center;\\n\\n    background:\\n        radial-gradient(\\n            circle at 50% 20%,\\n            rgba(92, 138, 235, 0.3),\\n            transparent 40%\\n        ),\\n        #152442;\\n\\n    color: white;\\n}\\n\\n.contact-content {\\n    max-width: 760px;\\n    margin: auto;\\n}\\n\\n.contact h2 {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    font-size: clamp(35px, 5vw, 58px);\\n    line-height: 1.1;\\n    margin: 15px 0 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.contact-content \u003e p:not(.section-label) {\\n    color: #b3bfd2;\\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\\n}\\n\\n.contact .section-label {\\n    color: #86aaff;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   FOOTER\\n========================= */\\n\\n.footer {\\n    padding: 45px 7% 20px;\\n    background: #0c1422;\\n    color: white;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-content {\\n    display: flex;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n    gap: 30px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-brand h3 {\\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-brand p,\\n.footer-bottom {\\n    color: #8290a5;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-links {\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 25px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-links a {\\n    color: #a6b2c4;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-links a:hover {\\n    color: white;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-bottom {\\n    margin-top: 35px;\\n    padding-top: 20px;\\n    border-top: 1px solid #26344a;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   FILTER\\n========================= */\\n\\n.portfolio-item.hidden {\\n    display: none;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   RESPONSIVE\\n========================= */\\n\\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\\n\\n    .nav-links {\\n        gap: 15px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-button {\\n        display: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n        text-align: center;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-description {\\n        margin: auto;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-buttons {\\n        justify-content: center;\\n    }\\n\\n    .about-content {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n    }\\n\\n    .services-grid,\\n    .why-me-grid {\\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    }\\n\\n    .portfolio-grid {\\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n\\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\\n\\n    .navbar {\\n        padding: 0 5%;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-links {\\n        display: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .section,\\n    .hero {\\n        padding: 80px 5%;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero h1 {\\n        font-size: 45px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-buttons {\\n        flex-direction: column;\\n    }\\n\\n    .services-grid,\\n    .why-me-grid,\\n    .portfolio-grid,\\n    .meta-ads-container {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n    }\\n\\n    .footer-content {\\n        flex-direction: column;\\n    }\\n\\n    .footer-links {\\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**This is the direction I would use for your site:** not “dark theme,” but a **mixed premium editorial/agency theme**. The important contrast is that the portfolio itself comes back to dark navy while the actual work sits on white cards, so your designs and reports become the visual focus.\",{},{\"_273\":417,\"_280\":441,\"_54\":442,\"_56\":442,\"_284\":443,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":444,\"_293\":294},\"b791261c-84d8-4217-b950-2710dbaf3232\",[404],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":446},1790861242.504941,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":445},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":430,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":431,\"_320\":431,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":439,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":439,\"_280\":450,\"_54\":451,\"_56\":452,\"_284\":453,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":454,\"_293\":294},\"65a32fa0-f25b-4135-b20a-1eeffaab33f3\",[417],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":466},1790861232.663,1790861265.951668,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":465},{\"_366\":455,\"_456\":34,\"_457\":458,\"_459\":460,\"_461\":462,\"_314\":430,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":431,\"_320\":431,\"_463\":14,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":464},\"dictation\",\"dictation_original_text\",\"Okay, everything you given is fine, but my expected output is not came because you giving if I ask a dark theme, it's completely you gave dark theme. There is no variation between section to section and sample to sample. And whenever we applying cards, padding, there is no differentiation. It is not nice now. We have to use different different colors. No, don't use all dark colors. Don't use all light colors. It should be professional and neat and beautiful.\",\"dictation_asset_pointer\",\"sediment://file_00000000842c8211b10150deff6b0ce8\",\"dictation_asset_format\",\"webm\",\"dictation_edited\",[],[458],{},{\"_273\":448,\"_280\":470,\"_54\":471,\"_56\":472,\"_284\":473,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":474,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"25e8616f-b3d7-4c83-a1e0-5d93617b232c\",[439],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":503},1790861049.203801,1790861130.611297,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":501},{\"_297\":475,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":476,\"_302\":477,\"_304\":478,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":479,\"_309\":480,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":481,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":482,\"_320\":482,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":468,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":500},[],[],[],{\"_325\":483,\"_327\":484,\"_485\":486,\"_487\":488,\"_489\":490,\"_491\":492},[],\"c45ea3a1-7fcf-41c5-8763-352ca0878077\",\"08646a6c-7628-4432-a054-2fcd6e5925ed\",{\"_273\":499,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},{\"_273\":498,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":34,\"_332\":494},\"2\",{\"_273\":497,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"3\",{\"_273\":496,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"4\",{\"_273\":495,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"5\",{\"_273\":493,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":34,\"_332\":494},\"f6rvi5\",\"html\",\"2mowvr\",\"mww4wq\",\"eofqte\",\"v3tx8d\",\"d04i11\",[337],[502],\"Yes ra. Let's make the **complete website properly now**.\\n\\nYou already have the folder structure:\\n\\n```text\\nSangeetha-Portfolio/\\n├── index.html\\n├── css/\\n│   └── style.css\\n├── js/\\n│   └── script.js\\n└── images/\\n    ├── logos/\\n    ├── posters/\\n    ├── videos/\\n    ├── meta-ads/\\n    └── seo/\\n```\\n\\n### 1. `index.html`\\n\\nReplace the **entire** `index.html` with this:\\n\\n```html\\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\\n\u003chtml lang=\\\"en\\\"\u003e\\n\u003chead\u003e\\n    \u003cmeta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003cmeta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003ctitle\u003eSangeetha | Digital Marketer \u0026 Creative Freelancer\u003c/title\u003e\\n\\n    \u003clink rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"css/style.css\\\"\u003e\\n\u003c/head\u003e\\n\\n\u003cbody\u003e\\n\\n\u003c!-- NAVBAR --\u003e\\n\u003cheader class=\\\"navbar\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003ca href=\\\"#home\\\" class=\\\"logo\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003cimg src=\\\"images/logo.png\\\" alt=\\\"Sangeetha Logo\\\"\u003e\\n    \u003c/a\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cnav class=\\\"nav-links\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003ca href=\\\"#home\\\"\u003eHome\u003c/a\u003e\\n        \u003ca href=\\\"#about\\\"\u003eAbout\u003c/a\u003e\\n        \u003ca href=\\\"#services\\\"\u003eServices\u003c/a\u003e\\n        \u003ca href=\\\"#work\\\"\u003eMy Work\u003c/a\u003e\\n        \u003ca href=\\\"#contact\\\"\u003eContact\u003c/a\u003e\\n    \u003c/nav\u003e\\n\\n    \u003ca href=\\\"#contact\\\" class=\\\"nav-button\\\"\u003e\\n        Let's Work Together\\n    \u003c/a\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/header\u003e\\n\\n\\n\u003cmain\u003e\\n\\n\u003c!-- HERO --\u003e\\n\u003csection id=\\\"home\\\" class=\\\"hero\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"hero-content\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp class=\\\"hero-small-text\\\"\u003e\\n            Hello, I'm Sangeetha\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003ch1\u003e\\n            Digital Marketer\u003cbr\u003e\\n            \u003cspan\u003e\u0026 Creative Freelancer\u003c/span\u003e\\n        \u003c/h1\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp class=\\\"hero-description\\\"\u003e\\n            I help businesses build a strong digital presence\\n            through creative design, engaging content and\\n            digital marketing solutions.\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"hero-buttons\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ca href=\\\"#work\\\" class=\\\"primary-button\\\"\u003e\\n                Explore My Work\\n            \u003c/a\u003e\\n\\n            \u003ca href=\\\"#contact\\\" class=\\\"secondary-button\\\"\u003e\\n                Let's Work Together\\n            \u003c/a\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"hero-visual\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"hero-card\\\"\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cp\u003eCREATIVE\u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n            \u003ch2\u003e\\n                Design.\u003cbr\u003e\\n                Create.\u003cbr\u003e\\n                Grow.\\n            \u003c/h2\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cspan\u003e\\n                Digital Marketing • Design • Content\\n            \u003c/span\u003e\\n\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/section\u003e\\n\\n\\n\u003c!-- ABOUT --\u003e\\n\u003csection id=\\\"about\\\" class=\\\"about section\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"section-heading\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp class=\\\"section-label\\\"\u003e\\n            ABOUT ME\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003ch2\u003e\\n            The person behind the work.\\n        \u003c/h2\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"about-content\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"about-text\\\"\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cp class=\\\"about-intro\\\"\u003e\\n                I'm Sangeetha, a B.Tech student and creative\\n                freelancer with an interest in digital marketing,\\n                design and content creation.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                I started freelancing to explore new things,\\n                develop practical skills and learn more about\\n                the digital world.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                I enjoy creating designs, editing videos,\\n                experimenting with new ideas and continuously\\n                learning new digital skills.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                I work with businesses from different industries\\n                and help them with their digital needs.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"about-highlights\\\"\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cdiv class=\\\"highlight-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cspan\u003e01\u003c/span\u003e\\n                \u003ch3\u003eCreative\u003c/h3\u003e\\n                \u003cp\u003e\\n                    Design and content focused on communicating\\n                    ideas clearly.\\n                \u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cdiv class=\\\"highlight-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cspan\u003e02\u003c/span\u003e\\n                \u003ch3\u003eCurious\u003c/h3\u003e\\n                \u003cp\u003e\\n                    Always exploring new tools, technologies\\n                    and creative ideas.\\n                \u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n            \u003cdiv class=\\\"highlight-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cspan\u003e03\u003c/span\u003e\\n                \u003ch3\u003eBusiness Focused\u003c/h3\u003e\\n                \u003cp\u003e\\n                    Creating digital solutions that help\\n                    businesses build their presence.\\n                \u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/section\u003e\\n\\n\\n\u003c!-- SERVICES --\u003e\\n\u003csection id=\\\"services\\\" class=\\\"services section\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"section-heading\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp class=\\\"section-label\\\"\u003e\\n            WHAT I DO\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003ch2\u003e\\n            Services I Offer\\n        \u003c/h2\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp\u003e\\n            Creative and digital solutions for businesses\\n            looking to build and grow their online presence.\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"services-grid\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003carticle class=\\\"service-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cspan class=\\\"service-number\\\"\u003e01\u003c/span\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eLogo Design\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Creative logo designs that help businesses\\n                create a recognizable visual identity.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003carticle class=\\\"service-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cspan class=\\\"service-number\\\"\u003e02\u003c/span\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003ePoster \u0026 Flyer Design\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Eye-catching promotional designs for\\n                social media, events and businesses.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003carticle class=\\\"service-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cspan class=\\\"service-number\\\"\u003e03\u003c/span\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eVideo Editing\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Engaging reels, short-form videos and\\n                promotional content for digital platforms.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003carticle class=\\\"service-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cspan class=\\\"service-number\\\"\u003e04\u003c/span\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eMeta Ads\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Instagram and Facebook advertising campaigns\\n                designed around business goals.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003carticle class=\\\"service-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cspan class=\\\"service-number\\\"\u003e05\u003c/span\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eSEO\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Search engine optimization to help businesses\\n                improve their online visibility.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003carticle class=\\\"service-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cspan class=\\\"service-number\\\"\u003e06\u003c/span\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eWebsite Design\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Clean and responsive websites designed\\n                for businesses and personal brands.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/section\u003e\\n\\n\\n\u003c!-- WORK --\u003e\\n\u003csection id=\\\"work\\\" class=\\\"work section\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"section-heading\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp class=\\\"section-label\\\"\u003e\\n            MY WORK\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003ch2\u003e\\n            Selected Creative Work\\n        \u003c/h2\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp\u003e\\n            A collection of my design, video editing and\\n            digital marketing work.\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003c!-- FILTERS --\u003e\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-filters\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cbutton class=\\\"filter-button active\\\" data-filter=\\\"all\\\"\u003e\\n            All\\n        \u003c/button\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cbutton class=\\\"filter-button\\\" data-filter=\\\"logos\\\"\u003e\\n            Logos\\n        \u003c/button\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cbutton class=\\\"filter-button\\\" data-filter=\\\"posters\\\"\u003e\\n            Posters\\n        \u003c/button\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cbutton class=\\\"filter-button\\\" data-filter=\\\"videos\\\"\u003e\\n            Videos\\n        \u003c/button\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cbutton class=\\\"filter-button\\\" data-filter=\\\"meta-ads\\\"\u003e\\n            Meta Ads\\n        \u003c/button\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cbutton class=\\\"filter-button\\\" data-filter=\\\"seo\\\"\u003e\\n            SEO\\n        \u003c/button\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003c!-- LOGOS --\u003e\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-category portfolio-item logos\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"category-heading\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eLogo Design\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003eBrand identity and logo projects.\u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-grid\\\"\u003e\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-image\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cimg src=\\\"images/logos/logo-1.png\\\"\\n                         alt=\\\"Logo Design Project 1\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003eLogo Design Project 01\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003eLogo Design\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-image\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cimg src=\\\"images/logos/logo-2.png\\\"\\n                         alt=\\\"Logo Design Project 2\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003eLogo Design Project 02\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003eLogo Design\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-image\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cimg src=\\\"images/logos/logo-3.png\\\"\\n                         alt=\\\"Logo Design Project 3\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003eLogo Design Project 03\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003eLogo Design\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003c!-- POSTERS --\u003e\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-category portfolio-item posters\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"category-heading\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003ePoster \u0026 Flyer Design\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003ePromotional and social media creatives.\u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-grid\\\"\u003e\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-image\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cimg src=\\\"images/posters/poster-1.png\\\"\\n                         alt=\\\"Poster Design Project 1\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003ePoster Design Project 01\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003ePoster Design\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-image\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cimg src=\\\"images/posters/poster-2.png\\\"\\n                         alt=\\\"Poster Design Project 2\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003ePoster Design Project 02\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003ePoster Design\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-image\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cimg src=\\\"images/posters/poster-3.png\\\"\\n                         alt=\\\"Poster Design Project 3\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003ePoster Design Project 03\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003ePoster Design\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003c!-- VIDEOS --\u003e\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-category portfolio-item videos\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"category-heading\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eVideo Editing\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003eShort-form videos and social media content.\u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-grid video-grid\\\"\u003e\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"video-container\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cvideo controls\u003e\\n                        \u003csource src=\\\"images/videos/video-1.mp4\\\"\\n                                type=\\\"video/mp4\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003c/video\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003eVideo Project 01\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003eShort-form Video Editing\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"video-container\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cvideo controls\u003e\\n                        \u003csource src=\\\"images/videos/video-2.mp4\\\"\\n                                type=\\\"video/mp4\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003c/video\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003eVideo Project 02\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003eShort-form Video Editing\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card\\\"\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"video-container\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cvideo controls\u003e\\n                        \u003csource src=\\\"images/videos/video-3.mp4\\\"\\n                                type=\\\"video/mp4\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003c/video\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003eVideo Project 03\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003eShort-form Video Editing\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003c!-- META ADS --\u003e\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-category portfolio-item meta-ads\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"category-heading\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eMeta Ads\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003eSelected campaign reports and results.\u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"meta-ads-container\\\"\u003e\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card report-card\\\"\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"report-image\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cimg src=\\\"images/meta-ads/report-1.png\\\"\\n                         alt=\\\"Meta Ads Client Report 1\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003eClient Campaign 01\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003eMeta Ads Campaign\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n\\n            \u003carticle class=\\\"portfolio-card report-card\\\"\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"report-image\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003cimg src=\\\"images/meta-ads/report-2.png\\\"\\n                         alt=\\\"Meta Ads Client Report 2\\\"\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-info\\\"\u003e\\n                    \u003ch4\u003eClient Campaign 02\u003c/h4\u003e\\n                    \u003cp\u003eMeta Ads Campaign\u003c/p\u003e\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n            \u003c/article\u003e\\n\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003c!-- SEO --\u003e\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"portfolio-category portfolio-item seo\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"category-heading\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eSEO\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003eCurrently working on SEO projects.\u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"coming-soon\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003cspan\u003eComing Soon\u003c/span\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                SEO project showcase will be added soon.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/section\u003e\\n\\n\\n\u003c!-- WHY WORK WITH ME --\u003e\\n\u003csection class=\\\"why-me section\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"section-heading\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp class=\\\"section-label\\\"\u003e\\n            WORK WITH ME\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003ch2\u003e\\n            Creative work with a purpose.\\n        \u003c/h2\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"why-me-grid\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"why-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eCreative Thinking\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                I enjoy exploring different ideas and creating\\n                designs that communicate clearly.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"why-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eContinuous Learning\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                I continuously explore new tools, techniques\\n                and digital skills.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"why-card\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eMultiple Skills\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Design, video, marketing, SEO and web development\\n                under one digital skill set.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/section\u003e\\n\\n\\n\u003c!-- CONTACT --\u003e\\n\u003csection id=\\\"contact\\\" class=\\\"contact section\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"contact-content\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp class=\\\"section-label\\\"\u003e\\n            HAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003ch2\u003e\\n            Let's create something meaningful\\n            for your business.\\n        \u003c/h2\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cp\u003e\\n            Whether you need a logo, creative content,\\n            video editing, advertising, SEO or a website,\\n            let's talk about your project.\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n\\n        \u003ca href=\\\"mailto:your-email@example.com\\\"\\n           class=\\\"primary-button\\\"\u003e\\n            Let's Work Together\\n        \u003c/a\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/section\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/main\u003e\\n\\n\\n\u003c!-- FOOTER --\u003e\\n\u003cfooter class=\\\"footer\\\"\u003e\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"footer-content\\\"\u003e\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"footer-brand\\\"\u003e\\n            \u003ch3\u003eSangeetha\u003c/h3\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Digital Marketer \u0026 Creative Freelancer\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n        \u003cdiv class=\\\"footer-links\\\"\u003e\\n\\n            \u003ca href=\\\"#home\\\"\u003eHome\u003c/a\u003e\\n            \u003ca href=\\\"#about\\\"\u003eAbout\u003c/a\u003e\\n            \u003ca href=\\\"#services\\\"\u003eServices\u003c/a\u003e\\n            \u003ca href=\\\"#work\\\"\u003eWork\u003c/a\u003e\\n            \u003ca href=\\\"#contact\\\"\u003eContact\u003c/a\u003e\\n\\n        \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\\n    \u003cdiv class=\\\"footer-bottom\\\"\u003e\\n        \u003cp\u003e\\n            © 2026 Sangeetha. All rights reserved.\\n        \u003c/p\u003e\\n    \u003c/div\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/footer\u003e\\n\\n\\n\u003cscript src=\\\"js/script.js\\\"\u003e\u003c/script\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/body\u003e\\n\u003c/html\u003e\\n```\\n\\n### 2. `css/style.css`\\n\\nReplace the **entire CSS** with this:\\n\\n```css\\n/* =========================\\n   RESET\\n========================= */\\n\\n* {\\n    margin: 0;\\n    padding: 0;\\n    box-sizing: border-box;\\n}\\n\\nhtml {\\n    scroll-behavior: smooth;\\n}\\n\\nbody {\\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\\n    background: #080c16;\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    line-height: 1.6;\\n}\\n\\na {\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n    color: inherit;\\n}\\n\\nimg,\\nvideo {\\n    max-width: 100%;\\n    display: block;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   NAVBAR\\n========================= */\\n\\n.navbar {\\n    position: sticky;\\n    top: 0;\\n    z-index: 1000;\\n\\n    height: 76px;\\n    padding: 0 7%;\\n\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n\\n    background: rgba(8, 12, 22, 0.9);\\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\\n    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);\\n}\\n\\n.logo img {\\n    width: 48px;\\n    height: 48px;\\n    object-fit: contain;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links {\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 30px;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links a {\\n    color: #aab4c7;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links a:hover {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-button,\\n.primary-button {\\n    background: #4f8cff;\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    padding: 12px 20px;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-button:hover,\\n.primary-button:hover {\\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\\n    background: #6a9fff;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   HERO\\n========================= */\\n\\n.hero {\\n    min-height: 88vh;\\n    padding: 90px 7%;\\n\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 70px;\\n\\n    background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%,\\n        rgba(79,140,255,0.12),\\n        transparent 35%);\\n}\\n\\n.hero-small-text,\\n.section-label {\\n    color: #5b9cff;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero h1 {\\n    margin: 18px 0;\\n    font-size: clamp(45px, 6vw, 78px);\\n    line-height: 1.05;\\n    letter-spacing: -3px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero h1 span {\\n    color: #5b9cff;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-description {\\n    max-width: 600px;\\n    color: #9ca8bb;\\n    font-size: 17px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-buttons {\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 14px;\\n    margin-top: 30px;\\n}\\n\\n.secondary-button {\\n    padding: 12px 20px;\\n    border: 1px solid #344056;\\n    border-radius: 8px;\\n    color: #dce4f2;\\n}\\n\\n.secondary-button:hover {\\n    border-color: #5b9cff;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-visual {\\n    display: flex;\\n    justify-content: center;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card {\\n    width: 330px;\\n    min-height: 380px;\\n    padding: 40px;\\n\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-direction: column;\\n    justify-content: flex-end;\\n\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(91,156,255,0.25);\\n    border-radius: 28px;\\n\\n    background:\\n        linear-gradient(145deg,\\n        #151e32,\\n        #0e1422);\\n\\n    box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card p {\\n    color: #5b9cff;\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card h2 {\\n    font-size: 42px;\\n    line-height: 1.05;\\n    margin: 18px 0;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card span {\\n    color: #8794aa;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   COMMON SECTIONS\\n========================= */\\n\\n.section {\\n    padding: 110px 7%;\\n}\\n\\n.section-heading {\\n    max-width: 700px;\\n    margin-bottom: 55px;\\n}\\n\\n.section-heading h2 {\\n    font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px);\\n    line-height: 1.1;\\n    margin: 12px 0 16px;\\n}\\n\\n.section-heading \u003e p:last-child {\\n    color: #8f9bb0;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   ABOUT\\n========================= */\\n\\n.about {\\n    background: #0b101c;\\n}\\n\\n.about-content {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;\\n    gap: 60px;\\n    align-items: center;\\n}\\n\\n.about-text p {\\n    color: #9ca8bb;\\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\\n    line-height: 1.8;\\n}\\n\\n.about-text .about-intro {\\n    color: #e8edf6;\\n    font-size: 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.about-highlights {\\n    display: grid;\\n    gap: 14px;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card {\\n    padding: 24px;\\n    background: #141b2b;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(79,140,255,0.14);\\n    border-radius: 16px;\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card:hover {\\n    transform: translateX(6px);\\n    border-color: rgba(79,140,255,0.4);\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card span,\\n.service-number {\\n    color: #5b9cff;\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card h3 {\\n    margin: 10px 0 6px;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card p {\\n    color: #8f9bb0;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   SERVICES\\n========================= */\\n\\n.services-grid {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\\n    gap: 18px;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card {\\n    padding: 28px;\\n    background: #101726;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(79,140,255,0.14);\\n    border-radius: 18px;\\n    transition: 0.25s;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card:hover {\\n    transform: translateY(-6px);\\n    border-color: rgba(79,140,255,0.45);\\n}\\n\\n.service-card h3 {\\n    margin: 18px 0 10px;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card p {\\n    color: #8f9bb0;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   PORTFOLIO\\n========================= */\\n\\n.work {\\n    background: #0b101c;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-filters {\\n    display: flex;\\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    gap: 10px;\\n    margin-bottom: 55px;\\n}\\n\\n.filter-button {\\n    padding: 10px 17px;\\n    background: transparent;\\n    color: #9ca8bb;\\n    border: 1px solid #29344a;\\n    border-radius: 7px;\\n    cursor: pointer;\\n}\\n\\n.filter-button:hover,\\n.filter-button.active {\\n    background: #4f8cff;\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    border-color: #4f8cff;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-category {\\n    margin-bottom: 75px;\\n}\\n\\n.category-heading {\\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\\n}\\n\\n.category-heading h3 {\\n    font-size: 25px;\\n}\\n\\n.category-heading p {\\n    color: #7f8ba0;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-grid {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\\n    gap: 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-card {\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    background: #111827;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\\n    border-radius: 16px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-image {\\n    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-image img {\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: 100%;\\n    object-fit: cover;\\n    transition: 0.35s;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-card:hover img {\\n    transform: scale(1.04);\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-info {\\n    padding: 18px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-info h4 {\\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.portfolio-info p {\\n    color: #7f8ba0;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   VIDEOS\\n========================= */\\n\\n.video-grid {\\n    align-items: start;\\n}\\n\\n.video-container {\\n    background: #05070c;\\n}\\n\\n.video-container video {\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: auto;\\n    display: block;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   META ADS\\n========================= */\\n\\n.meta-ads-container {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    gap: 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.report-image {\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n.report-image img {\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: auto;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   SEO\\n========================= */\\n\\n.coming-soon {\\n    padding: 55px;\\n    text-align: center;\\n\\n    border: 1px dashed #344056;\\n    border-radius: 18px;\\n}\\n\\n.coming-soon span {\\n    color: #5b9cff;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n}\\n\\n.coming-soon p {\\n    color: #7f8ba0;\\n    margin-top: 8px;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   WHY ME\\n========================= */\\n\\n.why-me-grid {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\\n    gap: 18px;\\n}\\n\\n.why-card {\\n    padding: 30px;\\n    background: #101726;\\n    border-radius: 18px;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\\n}\\n\\n.why-card h3 {\\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\\n}\\n\\n.why-card p {\\n    color: #8f9bb0;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   CONTACT\\n========================= */\\n\\n.contact {\\n    text-align: center;\\n    background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at center,\\n        rgba(79,140,255,0.12),\\n        transparent 45%);\\n}\\n\\n.contact-content {\\n    max-width: 750px;\\n    margin: auto;\\n}\\n\\n.contact h2 {\\n    font-size: clamp(35px, 5vw, 58px);\\n    line-height: 1.1;\\n    margin: 15px 0 20px;\\n}\\n\\n.contact-content \u003e p:not(.section-label) {\\n    color: #8f9bb0;\\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   FOOTER\\n========================= */\\n\\n.footer {\\n    padding: 45px 7% 20px;\\n    background: #060a12;\\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);\\n}\\n\\n.footer-content {\\n    display: flex;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n    gap: 30px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-brand h3 {\\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-brand p,\\n.footer-bottom {\\n    color: #727e92;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-links {\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 25px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-links a {\\n    color: #8f9bb0;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-links a:hover {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n}\\n\\n.footer-bottom {\\n    margin-top: 35px;\\n    padding-top: 20px;\\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   HIDDEN PORTFOLIO ITEMS\\n========================= */\\n\\n.portfolio-item.hidden {\\n    display: none;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================\\n   RESPONSIVE\\n========================= */\\n\\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\\n\\n    .nav-links {\\n        gap: 15px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-button {\\n        display: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n        text-align: center;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-description {\\n        margin: auto;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-buttons {\\n        justify-content: center;\\n    }\\n\\n    .about-content {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n    }\\n\\n    .services-grid,\\n    .why-me-grid {\\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    }\\n\\n    .portfolio-grid {\\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    }\\n\\n}\\n\\n\\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\\n\\n    .navbar {\\n        padding: 0 5%;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-links {\\n        display: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .section,\\n    .hero {\\n        padding: 80px 5%;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero h1 {\\n        font-size: 45px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-buttons {\\n        flex-direction: column;\\n    }\\n\\n    .services-grid,\\n    .why-me-grid,\\n    .portfolio-grid,\\n    .meta-ads-container {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n    }\\n\\n    .footer-content {\\n        flex-direction: column;\\n    }\\n\\n    .footer-links {\\n        flex-wrap: wrap;\\n    }\\n\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### 3. `js/script.js`\\n\\nReplace the **entire JavaScript** with this:\\n\\n```javascript\\n// Portfolio filter\\n\\nconst filterButtons = document.querySelectorAll(\\\".filter-button\\\");\\nconst portfolioItems = document.querySelectorAll(\\\".portfolio-item\\\");\\n\\nfilterButtons.forEach(button =\u003e {\\n\\n    button.addEventListener(\\\"click\\\", () =\u003e {\\n\\n        const filter = button.dataset.filter;\\n\\n        filterButtons.forEach(btn =\u003e {\\n            btn.classList.remove(\\\"active\\\");\\n        });\\n\\n        button.classList.add(\\\"active\\\");\\n\\n        portfolioItems.forEach(item =\u003e {\\n\\n            if (filter === \\\"all\\\" || item.classList.contains(filter)) {\\n                item.classList.remove(\\\"hidden\\\");\\n            } else {\\n                item.classList.add(\\\"hidden\\\");\\n            }\\n\\n        });\\n\\n    });\\n\\n});\\n```\\n\\n### Important ra ⚠️\\n\\nFor now, these image/video names are expected:\\n\\n```text\\nimages/logos/logo-1.png\\nimages/logos/logo-2.png\\nimages/logos/logo-3.png\\n\\nimages/posters/poster-1.png\\nimages/posters/poster-2.png\\nimages/posters/poster-3.png\\n\\nimages/videos/video-1.mp4\\nimages/videos/video-2.mp4\\nimages/videos/video-3.mp4\\n\\nimages/meta-ads/report-1.png\\nimages/meta-ads/report-2.png\\n```\\n\\n**Nee actual files ki exact names different unte problem ledu** — next we will add your real files and change only those paths.\\n\\nAlso, contact lo:\\n\\n```html\\nyour-email@example.com\\n```\\n\\ntemporary ga undi. **Nee actual contact details last lo replace chestham.**\\n\\n### Now do only this:\\n\\n1. `index.html` → complete code paste\\n2. `style.css` → complete code paste\\n3. `script.js` → complete code paste\\n4. Save all\\n5. Open `index.html` in browser\\n\\n**Ippudu website structure complete.** Next manam nee **actual logo → 3 logos → 3 posters → 3 videos → 2 Meta Ads reports** one-by-one add cheddam.\",{},{\"_273\":468,\"_280\":507,\"_54\":508,\"_56\":508,\"_284\":509,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":510,\"_293\":294},\"04142b3f-fa89-4631-ba83-4a6c8b97b3dd\",[448],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":512},1790861049.19947,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":511},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":481,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":482,\"_320\":482,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":505,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":505,\"_280\":516,\"_54\":517,\"_56\":518,\"_284\":519,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":520,\"_293\":294},\"221f2f2e-bd22-40ab-b8c1-d2003aa42c8c\",[468],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":525},1790861041.701,1790861090.532986,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":523},{\"_366\":521,\"_314\":481,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":482,\"_320\":482,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":522},[],[524],\"start\",{},{\"_273\":514,\"_280\":529,\"_54\":530,\"_56\":531,\"_284\":532,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":533,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"99970da0-967b-4afc-b339-00a86ed24ed9\",[505],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":544},1790861033.021369,1790861035.504076,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":542},{\"_297\":534,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":535,\"_302\":536,\"_304\":537,\"_306\":109,\"_309\":538,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":539,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":540,\"_320\":540,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":527,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":541},[],[],[],[],\"e8df4268-e28e-4c5b-9711-ec8600cbcb97\",\"84c661b4-35ac-43ab-8e26-8e8ea260d267\",[337],[543],\"Ha ra, I understand. You mean **don’t keep giving separate CSS blocks**. You want me to give you the **complete HTML + CSS + JavaScript together**, properly connected, so you can just put it into the project and run it.\\n\\nWe’ll do the **entire website end-to-end**:\\n- HTML → all sections\\n- CSS → complete professional design\\n- JavaScript → navbar/filter/animations/interactions\\n- Your actual work → added afterward\\n- No unnecessary huge explanations\\n\\nAnd I’ll keep the code **clean enough that you can explain it in an interview**, not some unnecessarily complicated 1000-line code.\\n\\nSend me **“start”**, and I’ll give you the complete 3-file version.\",{},{\"_273\":527,\"_280\":548,\"_54\":549,\"_56\":549,\"_284\":550,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":551,\"_293\":294},\"70900355-c03b-4556-9d2b-28166b4ef5c0\",[514],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":553},1790861033.010452,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":552},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":539,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":540,\"_320\":540,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":546,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":546,\"_280\":557,\"_54\":558,\"_56\":559,\"_284\":560,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":561,\"_293\":294},\"a4952efa-3c84-459f-8102-0811f4fe09f3\",[527],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":567},1790861022.977,1790861035.994424,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":566},{\"_366\":562,\"_456\":34,\"_457\":563,\"_459\":564,\"_461\":462,\"_314\":539,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":540,\"_320\":540,\"_463\":14,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":565},\"Hey, see, we are totally HTML, JavaScript. Do all the. Please pass, give me enter. Pass, pass. Don't give.\",\"sediment://file_000000008bd88211ad0714b16ba5b75b\",[],[563],{},{\"_273\":555,\"_280\":571,\"_54\":572,\"_56\":573,\"_284\":574,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":575,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"31c4ef64-87be-4410-8bcd-2a74a7d30fa2\",[546],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":599},1790860957.143136,1790860972.510306,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":597},{\"_297\":576,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":577,\"_302\":578,\"_304\":579,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":580,\"_309\":581,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":582,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":583,\"_320\":583,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":569,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":596},[],[586],[],{\"_325\":584},[],\"a76216e4-95c1-42a8-a4b0-b1a8dd12ef75\",\"589af967-0db8-4e90-b146-61e7b01185c2\",{\"_273\":585,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"my8l03\",{\"_50\":587,\"_588\":589,\"_590\":591,\"_592\":593,\"_47\":589,\"_594\":595},\"followup_a\",\"matched_text\",\"Next manam **My Work / Portfolio section** ni build cheddam\",\"start_idx\",1308,\"end_idx\",1367,\"prompt_text\",\"Build the My Work / Portfolio section\",[337],[598],\"Ha ra 👍 **About section done anukundam.**\\n\\n### Next → Services section\\n\\nNee HTML lo 6 services already unnayi:\\n\\n1. Logo Design  \\n2. Poster \u0026 Flyer Design  \\n3. Video Editing  \\n4. Meta Ads  \\n5. SEO  \\n6. Website Design  \\n\\nIppudu **Services ni premium cards laga** chuddam. `style.css` bottom lo idi add cheyyi:\\n\\n```css\\n/* Services */\\n.services-grid {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\\n    gap: 18px;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card {\\n    position: relative;\\n    padding: 28px;\\n    background: #141b2b;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.14);\\n    border-radius: 18px;\\n    transition: 0.25s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card:hover {\\n    transform: translateY(-6px);\\n    border-color: rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.45);\\n}\\n\\n.service-number {\\n    color: #5b9cff;\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card h3 {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    margin: 18px 0 10px;\\n}\\n\\n.service-card p {\\n    color: #8f9bb0;\\n    line-height: 1.7;\\n    margin: 0;\\n}\\n\\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\\n    .services-grid {\\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\\n    .services-grid {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**Ctrl + S → browser refresh.**\\n\\nResult: **3 cards per row on laptop**, clean dark premium look, and mobile lo automatically 1/2 columns ki adjust avutundi.\\n\\nNext manam **My Work / Portfolio section** ni build cheddam — akkada nee actual logos, posters, videos, Meta Ads reports add chestham.\",{},{\"_273\":569,\"_280\":603,\"_54\":604,\"_56\":604,\"_284\":605,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":606,\"_293\":294},\"767bc5ec-d577-4eb7-bc80-e45baf27859b\",[555],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":608},1790860957.124625,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":607},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":582,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":583,\"_320\":583,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":601,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":601,\"_280\":612,\"_54\":613,\"_56\":614,\"_284\":615,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":616,\"_293\":294},\"a2b84249-ca07-4276-9ab3-911eee1e6b16\",[569],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":621},1790860949.431,1790860962.811894,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":619},{\"_366\":617,\"_314\":582,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":583,\"_320\":583,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":618},[],[620],\"ha\",{},{\"_273\":610,\"_280\":625,\"_54\":626,\"_56\":627,\"_284\":628,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":629,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"79c4b749-192c-4b01-ac82-f5bba4fed2bc\",[601],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":643},1790860927.177815,1790860935.037973,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":641},{\"_297\":630,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":631,\"_302\":632,\"_304\":633,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":634,\"_309\":635,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":636,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":637,\"_320\":637,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":623,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":640},[],[],[],{\"_325\":638},[],\"9f68c6bb-cccf-4753-a405-3740cfc1fce4\",\"0e3e934f-9c85-48b9-9491-0085935e5fe2\",{\"_273\":639,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"f3glxe\",[337],[642],\"Ha ra 😄 **About section ki veldham.**\\n\\nNee current `index.html` lo About section already correct ga undi. **HTML ni ippudu touch cheyyaku.**\\n\\n`style.css` bottom lo **small CSS block** add cheyyi:\\n\\n```css\\n/* About */\\n.about-content {\\n    display: grid;\\n    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;\\n    gap: 60px;\\n    align-items: center;\\n}\\n\\n.about-text p {\\n    color: #aab4c7;\\n    line-height: 1.8;\\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\\n}\\n\\n.about-highlights {\\n    display: grid;\\n    gap: 14px;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card {\\n    padding: 22px;\\n    background: #141b2b;\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.14);\\n    border-radius: 16px;\\n    transition: 0.25s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card:hover {\\n    transform: translateX(6px);\\n    border-color: rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.4);\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card h3 {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\\n}\\n\\n.highlight-card p {\\n    color: #8f9bb0;\\n    line-height: 1.6;\\n    margin: 0;\\n}\\n\\n@media (max-width: 800px) {\\n    .about-content {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n        gap: 35px;\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**Ctrl + S → Refresh.**\\n\\nThis keeps the About section **simple, premium and readable**—no unnecessary huge code.\\n\\nThen send me the screenshot. **Next we'll do Services.**\",{},{\"_273\":623,\"_280\":647,\"_54\":648,\"_56\":648,\"_284\":649,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":650,\"_293\":294},\"9608ab0b-56be-4dfb-9928-f87ec152340d\",[610],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":652},1790860927.177371,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":651},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":636,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":637,\"_320\":637,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":645,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":645,\"_280\":656,\"_54\":657,\"_56\":658,\"_284\":659,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":660,\"_293\":294},\"5a3f87b7-89fb-49bf-b56e-dc809620fafc\",[623],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":665},1790860914.304,1790860929.296199,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":663},{\"_366\":661,\"_314\":636,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":637,\"_320\":637,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":662},[],[664],\"a\",{},{\"_273\":654,\"_280\":669,\"_54\":670,\"_56\":671,\"_284\":672,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":673,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"56b7cf19-7373-4612-bc0b-2f4321778e70\",[645],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":684},1790860890.65992,1790860924.49872,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":682},{\"_297\":674,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":675,\"_302\":676,\"_304\":677,\"_306\":109,\"_309\":678,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":679,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":680,\"_320\":680,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":667,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":681},[],[],[],[],\"3e11058a-d4cb-408a-bf94-0a644aed3b5c\",\"565c6f93-6c46-4dd0-9f2c-743f8477c8a9\",[337],[683],\"Done ra 🔥\\n\\n### Next: **About Me section**\\n\\nWe already have the content. I don't want to add huge CSS again.\\n\\nWe'll make it look like a **premium freelancer introduction**, not a resume:\\n\\n**Left side**\\n\u003e ABOUT ME  \\n\u003e The person behind the work.\\n\\nYour short introduction.\\n\\n**Right side**\\nThree compact cards:\\n- **Creative**\\n- **Curious**\\n- **Business Focused**\\n\\nAnd we'll add a subtle visual accent so the section doesn't look like plain text.\\n\\n### Your website flow now\\n\\n✅ Logo  \\n✅ Navbar  \\n✅ Hero  \\n➡️ **About Me** ← NOW  \\n⬜ Services  \\n⬜ My Work  \\n⬜ Why Work With Me  \\n⬜ Contact  \\n⬜ Footer\\n\\nFor the next step, **don't paste any code to me.** I'll give you only the small CSS/HTML changes you need.\",{},{\"_273\":667,\"_280\":688,\"_54\":689,\"_56\":689,\"_284\":690,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":691,\"_293\":294},\"5f844273-8b46-42de-822e-d805b8a1f61e\",[654],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":693},1790860890.653987,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":692},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":679,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":680,\"_320\":680,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":686,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":686,\"_280\":697,\"_54\":698,\"_56\":698,\"_284\":699,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":700,\"_291\":701,\"_293\":294},\"aeef735d-34e4-4d9a-ba5c-d026cd612772\",[667],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":704},1790860890.645365,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":703},0,{\"_702\":34,\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":679,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":680,\"_320\":680,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":695,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},\"rebase_system_message\",[355],{},{\"_273\":695,\"_280\":708,\"_54\":709,\"_56\":710,\"_284\":711,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":712,\"_293\":294},\"75e7d39f-fcac-4c29-aa58-fbb5d16a6306\",[686],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":717},1790860882.874,1790860894.111821,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":715},{\"_366\":713,\"_314\":679,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":680,\"_320\":680,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":714},[],[716],\"ok done next anti\",{},{\"_273\":706,\"_280\":721,\"_54\":722,\"_56\":723,\"_284\":724,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":725,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"abbdda4e-dd47-4ac8-a709-c746c299a3b2\",[695],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":736},1790860843.038668,1790860847.85076,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":734},{\"_297\":726,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":727,\"_302\":728,\"_304\":729,\"_306\":109,\"_309\":730,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":731,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":732,\"_320\":732,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":719,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":733},[],[],[],[],\"303797ef-120b-44a7-8007-259e8ab0778a\",\"cf27e4c6-18a1-4a2b-a0cb-4b7c5983dde4\",[337],[735],\"Exactly ra. **You're right.** I was making the code unnecessarily long.\\n\\nAnd don't worry about the interviewer point: **they won't expect you to memorize 900 lines of CSS.** A real project can contain hundreds of lines, but you should understand the important parts and be able to explain the structure and your decisions.\\n\\nFrom now on, I'll keep our website code:\\n\\n- **Professional**\\n- **Clean**\\n- **Not unnecessarily lengthy**\\n- **Easy for you to understand and explain**\\n- **Reusable instead of repeating CSS**\\n- Only add code when that feature actually needs it\\n\\nFor example, if an interviewer asks:\\n\\n\u003e **“How did you style your navbar?”**\\n\\nYou should be able to say:\\n\\n\u003e “I used CSS Flexbox to arrange the logo, navigation links and CTA button. I used a dark background with a subtle border and shadow, and added hover effects to make the navigation interactive.”\\n\\nThat's enough. You don't need to explain every CSS property.\\n\\nAnd if they ask:\\n\\n\u003e **“Why did you use CSS instead of a framework?”**\\n\\nYou can say:\\n\\n\u003e “For this project, I wanted to create the visual design myself and practice responsive CSS, so I used HTML, CSS and JavaScript directly.”\\n\\nThat's actually a good explanation for **your own project**.\\n\\n### From now on 🚀\\n\\nI'll give you **small, focused code changes**, not another 500–900 lines unless there is genuinely no better option.\\n\\nNow **refresh the website after the CSS we just added** and send me the screenshot. We'll continue directly with the next section.\",{},{\"_273\":719,\"_280\":740,\"_54\":741,\"_56\":741,\"_284\":742,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":743,\"_293\":294},\"cc313ee6-409f-4e98-8034-9a24cbcfab8c\",[706],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":745},1790860843.038301,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":744},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":731,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":732,\"_320\":732,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":738,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":738,\"_280\":749,\"_54\":750,\"_56\":751,\"_284\":752,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":753,\"_293\":294},\"55de9eb7-6652-4294-948e-c6d26b0c94e3\",[719],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":759},1790860833.823,1790860848.505374,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":758},{\"_366\":754,\"_456\":34,\"_457\":755,\"_459\":756,\"_461\":462,\"_314\":731,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":732,\"_320\":732,\"_463\":14,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":757},\"Earlier you given 900 lines of code. Again you given this much of too text. How is it possible, yeah? Okay, this time okay. Next time, honest, don't give. Okay, it should be professional and it should be very nice. But too much of text means it is very heavy. Interviewer asked all this much of lines code. You only written. How can I answer?\",\"sediment://file_000000002b108211bcd6d3e21d37d7fa\",[],[755],{},{\"_273\":747,\"_280\":763,\"_54\":764,\"_56\":765,\"_284\":766,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":767,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"e1e75bf3-0289-407b-9dcc-b683e2f13484\",[738],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":781},1790860770.005735,1790860867.63037,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":779},{\"_297\":768,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":769,\"_302\":770,\"_304\":771,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":772,\"_309\":773,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":774,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":775,\"_320\":775,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":761,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":778},[],[],[],{\"_325\":776},[],\"b18359c9-549f-4fc3-9e09-f7a9311560d9\",\"fc3e1e9b-f4f8-4366-b389-1077847a7fae\",{\"_273\":777,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"b3q6q9\",[337],[780],\"Yes ra, **my mistake**. No more asking you to paste code. We already have your HTML and CSS structure from this chat. **We'll work directly from that and move fast.** ❤️\\n\\n### Do this now — only one thing\\n\\nOpen `style.css`, go to the **very bottom**, and paste this entire block:\\n\\n```css\\n/* =========================================\\n   PREMIUM NAVBAR + HERO UPGRADE\\n========================================= */\\n\\n.navbar {\\n    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 60px));\\n    margin: 28px auto 0;\\n    padding: 14px 16px 14px 24px;\\n\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    justify-content: space-between;\\n    gap: 28px;\\n\\n    background: rgba(18, 25, 42, 0.88);\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 255, 0.16);\\n    border-radius: 20px;\\n\\n    box-shadow:\\n        0 15px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35),\\n        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\\n\\n    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);\\n    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);\\n\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 100;\\n}\\n\\n.logo {\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    width: 82px;\\n    height: 58px;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n    border-radius: 10px;\\n    flex-shrink: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.logo img {\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: 100%;\\n    object-fit: contain;\\n    display: block;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links {\\n    display: flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 4px;\\n    padding: 5px;\\n\\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\\n    border-radius: 13px;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links a {\\n    position: relative;\\n    padding: 11px 17px;\\n\\n    color: #aeb8cc;\\n    font-size: 14px;\\n    font-weight: 600;\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n\\n    border-radius: 9px;\\n    transition: 0.25s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links a:hover {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    background: rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.12);\\n}\\n\\n.nav-links a:first-child {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    background: linear-gradient(\\n        135deg,\\n        rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.24),\\n        rgba(139, 108, 255, 0.18)\\n    );\\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(120, 160, 255, 0.1);\\n}\\n\\n.nav-button {\\n    padding: 13px 21px;\\n\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    background: linear-gradient(\\n        135deg,\\n        #4f8cff,\\n        #7c62f5\\n    );\\n\\n    border-radius: 11px;\\n    text-decoration: none;\\n\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n\\n    box-shadow:\\n        0 8px 25px rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.25);\\n\\n    transition: 0.25s ease;\\n    white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n\\n.nav-button:hover {\\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\\n    box-shadow:\\n        0 12px 30px rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.35);\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================================\\n   HERO UPGRADE\\n========================================= */\\n\\n.hero {\\n    position: relative;\\n    min-height: 720px;\\n    padding-top: 125px;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n}\\n\\n.hero::before {\\n    content: \\\"\\\";\\n    position: absolute;\\n    width: 500px;\\n    height: 500px;\\n    left: -220px;\\n    top: 80px;\\n\\n    background: rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.08);\\n    filter: blur(100px);\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n\\n    pointer-events: none;\\n}\\n\\n.hero::after {\\n    content: \\\"\\\";\\n    position: absolute;\\n    width: 450px;\\n    height: 450px;\\n    right: -180px;\\n    top: 100px;\\n\\n    background: rgba(139, 108, 255, 0.08);\\n    filter: blur(100px);\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n\\n    pointer-events: none;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-content {\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 2;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-small-text {\\n    display: inline-flex;\\n    align-items: center;\\n    gap: 9px;\\n\\n    padding: 10px 16px;\\n\\n    color: #79b2ff;\\n    background: rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.08);\\n\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.25);\\n    border-radius: 30px;\\n\\n    font-size: 13px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n    letter-spacing: 0.4px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-small-text::before {\\n    content: \\\"\\\";\\n    width: 7px;\\n    height: 7px;\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n    background: #4dd9ff;\\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #4dd9ff;\\n}\\n\\n.hero h1 {\\n    max-width: 780px;\\n    margin-top: 28px;\\n\\n    font-size: clamp(55px, 6vw, 86px);\\n    line-height: 0.98;\\n    letter-spacing: -3px;\\n    font-weight: 800;\\n\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n}\\n\\n.hero h1::first-line {\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-description {\\n    max-width: 650px;\\n    margin-top: 30px;\\n\\n    color: #9ca9c0;\\n    font-size: 17px;\\n    line-height: 1.8;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-buttons {\\n    display: flex;\\n    gap: 14px;\\n    margin-top: 35px;\\n}\\n\\n.primary-button,\\n.secondary-button {\\n    transition: 0.25s ease;\\n}\\n\\n.primary-button:hover,\\n.secondary-button:hover {\\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================================\\n   HERO CREATIVE CARD\\n========================================= */\\n\\n.hero-visual {\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 2;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card {\\n    position: relative;\\n    overflow: hidden;\\n\\n    background:\\n        linear-gradient(\\n            145deg,\\n            rgba(31, 52, 91, 0.95),\\n            rgba(18, 27, 48, 0.98)\\n        );\\n\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(117, 154, 235, 0.2);\\n    box-shadow:\\n        0 30px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),\\n        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card::before {\\n    content: \\\"\\\";\\n    position: absolute;\\n    width: 260px;\\n    height: 260px;\\n    right: -100px;\\n    top: -100px;\\n\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n    background: linear-gradient(\\n        135deg,\\n        rgba(79, 140, 255, 0.45),\\n        rgba(139, 108, 255, 0.15)\\n    );\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card::after {\\n    content: \\\"\\\";\\n    position: absolute;\\n    width: 170px;\\n    height: 170px;\\n    right: 40px;\\n    top: 55px;\\n\\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\\n    border-radius: 50%;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card p {\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 2;\\n\\n    color: #4dd9ff;\\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    font-weight: 800;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card h2 {\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 2;\\n\\n    margin-top: 25px;\\n\\n    color: #ffffff;\\n    font-size: 48px;\\n    line-height: 1.05;\\n    letter-spacing: -2px;\\n}\\n\\n.hero-card span {\\n    position: relative;\\n    z-index: 2;\\n\\n    display: block;\\n    margin-top: 35px;\\n\\n    color: #aab6ca;\\n    font-size: 12px;\\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\\n}\\n\\n\\n/* =========================================\\n   MOBILE\\n========================================= */\\n\\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\\n\\n    .navbar {\\n        width: calc(100% - 30px);\\n        padding: 12px 14px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-links {\\n        display: none;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-button {\\n        padding: 11px 15px;\\n        font-size: 12px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero {\\n        padding-top: 90px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero h1 {\\n        font-size: 58px;\\n        letter-spacing: -2px;\\n    }\\n}\\n\\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\\n\\n    .navbar {\\n        width: calc(100% - 20px);\\n        margin-top: 12px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .logo {\\n        width: 70px;\\n        height: 52px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .nav-button {\\n        padding: 10px 12px;\\n        font-size: 11px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero {\\n        padding-top: 70px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero h1 {\\n        font-size: 45px;\\n        line-height: 1;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-description {\\n        font-size: 15px;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-buttons {\\n        flex-direction: column;\\n        align-items: stretch;\\n    }\\n\\n    .hero-card h2 {\\n        font-size: 40px;\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### That's it for now.\\n\\n**Don't delete your existing CSS.** Just paste this **at the very bottom** of `style.css`.\\n\\nThen:\\n\\n**Ctrl + S → browser Ctrl + R**\\n\\nThis will override the old navbar/hero styles without you having to search through 900+ lines.\\n\\nAfter refresh, **just send me the screenshot**. I won't ask you to paste code again. We'll go straight to the next section and finish the website within your time.\",{},{\"_273\":761,\"_280\":785,\"_54\":786,\"_56\":786,\"_284\":787,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":14,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":788,\"_293\":294},\"7c6f5e3e-6e42-4025-9c05-1699f09c88cf\",[747],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":802},1790860770.001022,{\"_338\":800,\"_284\":801},{\"_789\":790,\"_791\":290,\"_792\":793,\"_794\":795,\"_796\":797,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":14,\"_314\":774,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":775,\"_320\":775,\"_306\":109,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":14,\"_323\":798,\"_799\":34,\"_324\":10},\"reasoning_status\",\"reasoning_ended\",\"finished_duration_sec\",\"reasoning_start_time\",1790860768.0146341,\"reasoning_end_time\",1790860769.9942715,\"reasoning_recap_type\",\"hide_all\",\"60783f9c-4b43-4341-bc75-db5210796ec0\",\"hide_inline_actions\",\"reasoning_recap\",\"Worked for a couple of seconds\",{},{\"_273\":783,\"_280\":806,\"_54\":807,\"_56\":807,\"_284\":808,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":700,\"_291\":809,\"_293\":294},\"577a8c4b-f7cf-47d1-b393-9e51748087fa\",[761],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":811},1790860768.153509,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":810},{\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":774,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":775,\"_320\":775,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":804,\"_324\":10,\"_353\":34,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":804,\"_280\":815,\"_54\":816,\"_56\":816,\"_284\":817,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":818,\"_293\":294},\"4441714c-1943-479e-8c7b-87604a8007d7\",[783],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":820},1790860768.14183,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":819},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":774,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":775,\"_320\":775,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":813,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":813,\"_280\":824,\"_54\":825,\"_56\":826,\"_284\":827,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":828,\"_293\":294},\"76a3ce83-6629-4af7-ba16-0aebbafa5854\",[804],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":835},1790860760.771,1790860786.447959,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":833},{\"_366\":829,\"_456\":34,\"_457\":830,\"_459\":831,\"_461\":462,\"_314\":774,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":775,\"_320\":775,\"_463\":14,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":832},\"Hey, please don't ask again and again to paste every code. You only give and you only check in your chart. Again you asking, I am... time is wasting. I have only half an hour to build this website. Please help me to build fast.\",\"sediment://file_00000000ffb48211a0834909f572f2d7\",[],[834],\"hsHey, please don't ask again and again to paste every code. You only give and you only check in your chart. Again you asking, I am... time is wasting. I have only half an hour to build this website. Please help me to build fast.\",{},{\"_273\":822,\"_280\":839,\"_54\":840,\"_56\":841,\"_284\":842,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":843,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"03c7e8cf-5872-4f8d-9d47-b618fc5d35cb\",[813],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":892},1790860710.591397,1790860714.177432,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":890},{\"_297\":844,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":845,\"_302\":846,\"_304\":847,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":848,\"_309\":849,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":850,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":851,\"_320\":851,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":837,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":889},[],[854,855,856,857,858,859,860],[],{\"_325\":852},[],\"b668d5b4-24e2-426c-ba0e-1c1418b0d92b\",\"2de38031-7c90-490f-a1fd-cc2d424ffb91\",{\"_273\":853,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},\"qz136j\",{\"_50\":587,\"_588\":885,\"_590\":886,\"_592\":887,\"_47\":885,\"_594\":888},{\"_50\":587,\"_588\":881,\"_590\":882,\"_592\":883,\"_47\":881,\"_594\":884},{\"_50\":587,\"_588\":877,\"_590\":878,\"_592\":879,\"_47\":877,\"_594\":880},{\"_50\":587,\"_588\":873,\"_590\":874,\"_592\":875,\"_47\":873,\"_594\":876},{\"_50\":587,\"_588\":869,\"_590\":870,\"_592\":871,\"_47\":869,\"_594\":872},{\"_50\":587,\"_588\":865,\"_590\":866,\"_592\":867,\"_47\":865,\"_594\":868},{\"_50\":587,\"_588\":861,\"_590\":862,\"_592\":863,\"_47\":861,\"_594\":864},\"dark theme + blue/purple accent maintain\",629,669,\"Maintain dark theme with blue/purple accent\",\"CTA more premium\",610,626,\"Make CTA more premium\",\"active link better\",589,607,\"Make active link better\",\"navigation cleaner\",568,586,\"Make navigation cleaner\",\"navbar glass effect\",546,565,\"Add navbar glass effect\",\"logo size/spacing improve\",518,543,\"Improve logo size and spacing\",\"aa complete navbar CSS ni send cheyyi\",428,465,\"Send me the complete navbar CSS\",[337],[891],\"Next ra 😎 **ippudu navbar + hero ni final professional look ki polish cheddam.**\\n\\nBut current screenshot already looks decent, so **whole CSS ni replace cheyyakunda**, only these 2 areas modify cheddam.\\n\\n### Step 1 — Navbar\\n\\nNee `style.css` lo existing **NAVBAR** section ni find cheyyi. Usually:\\n\\n```css\\n/* =========================\\n   NAVBAR\\n========================= */\\n```\\n\\nFrom that comment until the next major section, **aa complete navbar CSS ni send cheyyi**.\\n\\n**Nenu exact replacement CSS istha.**  \\nThen:\\n- logo size/spacing improve\\n- navbar glass effect\\n- navigation cleaner\\n- active link better\\n- CTA more premium\\n- dark theme + blue/purple accent maintain\\n\\n### Step 2 — Hero\\n\\nNavbar ayyaka hero ni polish cheddam. Right-side card ni kuda generic ga kakunda **creative freelancer feel** istham.\\n\\n**So first `NAVBAR` CSS section paste cheyyi ra.**\",{},{\"_273\":837,\"_280\":896,\"_54\":897,\"_56\":897,\"_284\":898,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":899,\"_293\":294},\"3a7c97a9-b102-4150-a04b-ce29cd6ca7e7\",[822],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":901},1790860710.578925,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":900},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":850,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":851,\"_320\":851,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":894,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":894,\"_280\":905,\"_54\":906,\"_56\":907,\"_284\":908,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":909,\"_293\":294},\"60129493-cc5b-4104-a233-3c70acbb3ee4\",[837],{\"_343\":373,\"_291\":914},1790860703.046,1790860714.369486,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":912},{\"_366\":910,\"_314\":850,\"_368\":-5,\"_318\":851,\"_320\":851,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},{\"_369\":911},[],[913],\"done next annti\",{},{\"_273\":903,\"_280\":918,\"_54\":919,\"_56\":920,\"_284\":921,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":922,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"091cadac-738a-472c-8727-76904820c497\",[894],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":946},1790860681.041685,1790860688.689107,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":944},{\"_297\":923,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":924,\"_302\":925,\"_304\":926,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":927,\"_309\":928,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":929,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":930,\"_320\":930,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":916,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":943},[],[],[],{\"_325\":931,\"_327\":932,\"_485\":933,\"_487\":934,\"_489\":935,\"_491\":936},[],\"fabeb94a-c052-4448-b313-2d7e9f7266b8\",\"18da335f-9106-44d5-8435-1711457f0228\",{\"_273\":942,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":34,\"_332\":494},{\"_273\":941,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},{\"_273\":940,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},{\"_273\":939,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":34,\"_332\":494},{\"_273\":938,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},{\"_273\":937,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":34,\"_332\":494},\"ghqv4l\",\"v9d1g9\",\"sp9080\",\"3lyh1l\",\"d2e7rv\",\"ugx1l2\",[337],[945],\"Ahh ra, **now I can see the issue clearly.** Your actual HTML structure is fine. 👍\\n\\nThe `html` showing at the top of the browser is coming from an **extra code-fence/text accidentally present in the file**, not from your `\u003chtml\u003e` tag.\\n\\n### Do this first\\n\\nIn `index.html`, press:\\n\\n**Ctrl + Home**\\n\\nThis takes you to the absolute first line.\\n\\nYour file must start **exactly** like this:\\n\\n```html\\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\\n\u003chtml lang=\\\"en\\\"\u003e\\n\u003chead\u003e\\n```\\n\\nThere should be **nothing before `\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e`**.\\n\\nSo if you see anything like:\\n\\n```text\\n```html\\n```\\n\\nor simply:\\n\\n```text\\nhtml\\n```\\n\\n**delete it.**\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Also one more thing\\n\\nAt the bottom of the portion you sent, I see:\\n\\n```html\\n\u003cspan\u003e\\n```\\n\\nand then your message ends with:\\n\\n```text\\n```\\n```\\n\\nThat ` ``` ` should **not** be inside your HTML file either.\\n\\nSo make sure you haven't accidentally pasted the Markdown code markers into `index.html`.\\n\\nYour actual HTML should contain:\\n\\n```html\\n\u003cspan\u003e\\n    Digital Marketing • Design • Content\\n\u003c/span\u003e\\n```\\n\\nand then continue with the closing tags.\\n\\n### After fixing\\n\\nPress:\\n\\n**Ctrl + S → browser refresh (Ctrl + R)**\\n\\nThe `html` text at the top should disappear. ✅\\n\\n**Don't change the CSS yet.** First let's remove this HTML issue, then we'll polish the navbar and hero.\",{},{\"_273\":916,\"_280\":950,\"_54\":951,\"_56\":951,\"_284\":952,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":14,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":953,\"_293\":294},\"915dc593-6737-4f97-bbf7-6eecbce63718\",[903],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":958},1790860680.983504,{\"_338\":800,\"_284\":957},{\"_789\":790,\"_791\":954,\"_792\":955,\"_794\":956,\"_796\":797,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":14,\"_314\":929,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":930,\"_320\":930,\"_306\":109,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":14,\"_323\":948,\"_799\":34,\"_324\":10},9,1790860671.617525,1790860680.8725371,\"Worked for 9s\",{},{\"_273\":948,\"_280\":962,\"_54\":963,\"_56\":963,\"_284\":964,\"_286\":965,\"_288\":14,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":966,\"_293\":294},\"0e7f5d4e-a769-44ed-88c3-eb447f31a25b\",[916],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":978},1790860680.942702,{\"_338\":969,\"_969\":970,\"_971\":972},\"in_progress\",{\"_789\":967,\"_792\":955,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":14,\"_314\":929,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":930,\"_320\":930,\"_306\":109,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":968,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},\"is_reasoning\",\"8dcdbd0b-060d-40e1-995e-6fb36da9b0e8\",\"thoughts\",[973],\"source_analysis_m