    \u003ca href=\\\"#contact\\\"\u003eContact\u003c/a\u003e\\r\\n        \u003c/nav\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n        \u003ca href=\\\"#contact\\\" class=\\\"nav-button\\\"\u003e\\r\\n            Let's Work Together\\r\\n        \u003c/a\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n    \u003c/header\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n    \u003cmain\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n        \u003csection id=\\\"home\\\" class=\\\"hero\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n            \u003cdiv class=\\\"hero-content\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                \u003cp class=\\\"hero-small-text\\\"\u003e\\r\\n                    Hello, I'm Sangeetha\\r\\n                \u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                \u003ch1\u003e\\r\\n                    Digital Marketer\\r\\n                    \u003cbr\u003e\\r\\n                    \u0026 Creative Freelancer\\r\\n                \u003c/h1\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                \u003cp class=\\\"hero-description\\\"\u003e\\r\\n                    I help businesses build a strong digital presence\\r\\n                    through creative design, engaging content and\\r\\n                    digital marketing solutions.\\r\\n                \u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"hero-buttons\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                    \u003ca href=\\\"#work\\\" class=\\\"primary-button\\\"\u003e\\r\\n                        Explore My Work\\r\\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                    \u003ca href=\\\"#contact\\\" class=\\\"secondary-button\\\"\u003e\\r\\n                        Let's Work Together\\r\\n                    \u003c/a\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                \u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n            \u003c/div\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n            \u003cdiv class=\\\"hero-visual\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                \u003cdiv class=\\\"hero-card\\\"\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                    \u003cp\u003eCREATIVE\u003c/p\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                    \u003ch2\u003e\\r\\n                        Design.\\r\\n                        \u003cbr\u003e\\r\\n                        Create.\\r\\n                        \u003cbr\u003e\\r\\n                        Grow.\\r\\n                    \u003c/h2\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n                    \u003cspan\u003e\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\n\",{},{\"_273\":989,\"_280\":1004,\"_54\":1005,\"_56\":1006,\"_284\":1007,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":1008,\"_293\":294,\"_295\":296},\"bd1a2803-65c8-4592-852c-02e0c60ecfc7\",[980],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":1024},1790860578.052316,1790860583.858727,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":1022},{\"_297\":1009,\"_299\":34,\"_300\":1010,\"_302\":1011,\"_304\":1012,\"_306\":109,\"_307\":1013,\"_309\":1014,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":34,\"_314\":1015,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":1016,\"_320\":1016,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":34,\"_323\":1002,\"_324\":10},{\"_50\":334,\"_335\":1021},[],[],[],{\"_325\":1017,\"_327\":1018},[],\"dd6dc344-da75-4d9e-9489-08de110c4615\",\"2820b003-741b-4ddc-bccb-2bb686e823ce\",{\"_273\":1020,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":14,\"_332\":-5},{\"_273\":1019,\"_330\":14,\"_331\":34,\"_332\":494},\"6ccxb0\",\"105tdt\",[337],[1023],\"Yes ra, screenshot chusa. **Overall dark theme is working**, but I can see a few things we should fix before moving ahead.\\n\\n### 1. Biggest issue — `html` appearing at top ❌\\n\\nTop-left lo:\\n\\n```text\\n“html\\n```\\n\\nkanipisthundi.\\n\\nIdi website lo accidentally text laga render avuthundi. **Definitely remove cheyyali.**\\n\\nMost likely `index.html` beginning lo something like:\\n\\n```html\\n```html\\n```\\n\\nor an extra `html` text undi.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 2. Your logo needs better treatment\\n\\nNee logo load avuthundi ✅, but currently **white square background tho very large** ga kanipisthundi.\\n\\nNavbar lo better ga:\\n\\n- logo slightly smaller\\n- proper spacing\\n- white box remove cheyyagaligithe remove\\n- logo ki clean premium placement\\n- navbar height konchem compact\\n\\n**Important:** Nee actual logo image itself white background tho unte, CSS alone completely remove cheyyalem. Transparent PNG version unte much better.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 3. Navbar\\n\\nCurrent:\\n\\n**Logo | Home About Services My Work Contact | Let's Work Together**\\n\\nStructure correct, but it looks slightly like a generic template.\\n\\nManam make cheyyagaligedi:\\n\\n- cleaner glass/dark navbar\\n- logo left with better spacing\\n- navigation more elegant\\n- active link subtle glow\\n- CTA button more premium\\n- slightly stronger separation from hero\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 4. Hero is actually looking good 👍\\n\\nThis part:\\n\\n\u003e **Digital Marketer  \\n\u003e \u0026 Creative  \\n\u003e Freelancer**\\n\\nis strong.\\n\\nThe dark background + blue/purple accents are working well.\\n\\nBut the right-side card:\\n\\n\u003e CREATIVE  \\n\u003e Design.  \\n\u003e Create.  \\n\u003e Grow.\\n\\ncan be made **more visually interesting and connected to your actual freelancing work**, rather than looking like a generic template card.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### So let's do it in this order:\\n\\n**Step 1 → Remove the `html` text**  \\n**Step 2 → Fix/polish your logo in navbar**  \\n**Step 3 → Upgrade navbar**  \\n**Step 4 → Upgrade hero visual**  \\n**Step 5 → Then move to About section**\\n\\nFirst, **open `index.html` and show me the very top portion — around lines 1–20.** I'll tell you exactly what to delete so we don't accidentally disturb the rest of your HTML.\",{},{\"_273\":1002,\"_280\":1028,\"_54\":1029,\"_56\":1029,\"_284\":1030,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":14,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":1031,\"_293\":294},\"5f816db4-4549-4a04-ad18-ff33fd190f92\",[989],{\"_343\":344,\"_291\":1035},1790860578.048437,{\"_338\":800,\"_284\":801},{\"_789\":790,\"_791\":290,\"_792\":1032,\"_794\":1033,\"_796\":797,\"_311\":312,\"_313\":14,\"_314\":1015,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":1016,\"_320\":1016,\"_306\":109,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_322\":14,\"_323\":1034,\"_799\":34,\"_324\":10},1790860576.9109116,1790860578.0406628,\"82c7ad82-904d-4596-9795-64321b2f93f5\",{},{\"_273\":1026,\"_280\":1039,\"_54\":1040,\"_56\":1040,\"_284\":1041,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\