ve `logo.png` anywhere else**. It's in the correct location.\\n\\nOne small thing I notice: your Explorer is showing **“Extract all”** at the top, which means you may currently be viewing the project **inside the ZIP/compressed folder** rather than the fully extracted project.\\n\\nBefore we continue, let's make sure we're editing the actual extracted folder.\\n\\n### Check this 👇\\n\\nIn the address bar, you currently have:\\n\\n**Downloads → Sangeetha-Portfolio-Starter → Sangeetha-Portfolio → images**\\n\\nIf you see **“Extract all”**, that's a sign this may still be inside the ZIP.\\n\\nGo to **Downloads** and check whether you have:\\n\\n- `Sangeetha-Portfolio-Starter.zip`\\n- `Sangeetha-Portfolio-Starter` **folder**\\n\\nIf both are there, open the **folder**, not the ZIP.\\n\\nThen open:\\n\\n`Sangeetha-Portfolio-Starter → Sangeetha-Portfolio → images`\\n\\nand confirm `logo.png` is there.\\n\\nOnce that's confirmed, we'll open the website and check whether **your logo appears in the navbar**.\",{},{\"_273\":1395,\"_280\":1419,\"_54\":1420,\"_56\":1420,\"_284\":1421,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":1422,\"_293\":294},\"83925a2f-dcf8-4f3f-aa09-4ff2908a146b\",[1371],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":1424},1790859872.316006,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":1423},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":1408,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":1409,\"_320\":1409,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":1417,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":1417,\"_280\":1428,\"_54\":1429,\"_56\":1429,\"_284\":1430,\"_286\":287,\"_288\":34,\"_289\":700,\"_291\":1431,\"_293\":294},\"1f282f22-9bec-408d-964f-d56ce38a00a7\",[1395],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":1433},1790859872.224354,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":1432},{\"_1052\":1053,\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":1408,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":1409,\"_320\":1409,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":1426,\"_324\":10,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":1426,\"_280\":1437,\"_54\":1438,\"_56\":1439,\"_284\":1440,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":1441,\"_293\":294},\"e0