\\n```\\n\\n### Your own logo\\n\\nFor your **personal website logo**, paste it directly inside the main `images` folder:\\n\\n```text\\nimages/\\n├── logo.png        ← YOUR OWN LOGO ✅\\n├── logos/          ← client logo works\\n├── posters/\\n├── meta-ads/\\n├── seo/\\n└── videos/\\n```\\n\\nSo from the folder shown in your screenshot, **don't open `logos`**.\\n\\nJust put your own logo file **here**, in the same place where the `logos`, `posters`, `videos` folders are visible.\\n\\nAnd name it:\\n\\n**`logo.png`**\\n\\nThen our existing HTML:\\n\\n```html\\n\u003cimg src=\\\"images/logo.png\\\" alt=\\\"Sangeetha Logo\\\"\u003e\\n```\\n\\nwill automatically pick it up. ✅\\n\\nAfter you paste it, **tell me “done”**, and we'll check the logo in the website before moving to your 3 logo projects.\",{},{\"_273\":1459,\"_280\":1487,\"_54\":1488,\"_56\":1488,\"_284\":1489,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":700,\"_291\":1490,\"_293\":294},\"9c204926-1b12-4ce4-af26-cf2a96dc3ad3\",[1435],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":1492},1790859772.701073,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":1491},{\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":1472,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":1473,\"_320\":1473,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":1485,\"_324\":10,\"_353\":34,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":1485,\"_280\":1496,\"_54\":1497,\"_56\":1497,\"_284\":1498,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":700,\"_291\":1499,\"_293\":294},\"91babcf3-b7a0-4832-9c91-3bfeecc0cc5c\",[1459],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":1501},1790859772.691394,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":1500},{\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":1472,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":1473,\"_320\":1473,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67,\"_323\":1494,\"_324\":10,\"_353\":34,\"_322\":14},[355],{},{\"_273\":1494,\"_280\":1505,\"_54\":1506,\"_56\":1506,\"_284\":1507,\"_286\":287,\"_289\":290,\"_291\":1508,\"_293\":294},\"22588c6a-6aa5-4bb9-a51e-56ed2762c528\",[1485],{\"_343\":356,\"_291\":1510},1790859772.669739,{\"_338\":339,\"_340\":1509},{\"_353\":34,\"_306\":109,\"_311\":312,\"_314\":1472,\"_316\":317,\"_318\":1473,\"_320\":1473,\"_321\":109,\"_66\":67